{"unit_id":"makuralymi__dsh-webUI-Glass-Theme#card-zh","repo":"makuralymi/dsh-webUI-Glass-Theme","commit":"c2be1d9d171c533da441d560dc3411344dfc6ea4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-frosted-glass（DSH Web 主题插件）：为 Web 界面叠加毛玻璃外观，也可切换为 Monet 配色主题。它在设置中加入主题、背景、动画和通知选项，并通过主题 token 与浏览器样式改变界面。主要功能包括自定义图片或视频壁纸、背景轮播、定时切换明暗主题，以及会话运行时的输入框光效。适合想调整 DSH Web 外观和主题行为的用户；壁纸 Monet 配色还可从桌面壁纸提取颜色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4000-4050","lib/client.js:4117-4228","lib/index.js:372-398"]}
{"unit_id":"makuralymi__dsh-webUI-Glass-Theme#card-en","repo":"makuralymi/dsh-webUI-Glass-Theme","commit":"c2be1d9d171c533da441d560dc3411344dfc6ea4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-client-ui-frosted-glass adds a frosted-glass look and optional Monet colors to DSH Web. Its settings cover themes, custom image or video wallpapers, slideshows, scheduled light/dark switching, composer lighting and system notifications. Monet colors can be derived from the desktop wallpaper.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4000-4050","lib/client.js:4117-4228","lib/index.js:372-398"]}
